vpkMerge.confirmBody:
Merge the selected {count} VPKs into one pack?

· Same-named files in the later pack override earlier ones (order = the list order you see);
· Merging is export only and does **not** change the original Mods, addonlist.txt, or priorities;
· To use the merged pack, enable it yourself in-game.

snapshot.restoreConfirmBody:
Execute the restore plan?

Enable {enable} · Disable {disable} · Add back {restore} · Overwrite {overwrite} · Skip {skip} · Missing {missing}

Mods added after the snapshot are moved to disabled, and files with different contents are overwritten; the current addonlist.txt is backed up automatically before execution.

